### ==============================================================================
### COLECCIÓN DE PRUEBAS MANUALES HTTP - SISTEMA DISTRIBUIDO
### ==============================================================================

@userUrl = http://localhost:3000
@inventoryUrl = http://localhost:3001
@checkoutUrl = http://localhost:3002

### 1. HEALTHCHECKS
### 1.1 Healthcheck User Service
GET {{userUrl}}/health

### 1.2 Healthcheck Inventory Service (Verifica Redis y MongoDB)
GET {{inventoryUrl}}/health

### 1.3 Healthcheck Checkout Service
GET {{checkoutUrl}}/health

### ==============================================================================
### 2. AUTENTICACIÓN Y ROLES (USER SERVICE)
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Registro de Usuario ADMIN
# @name registrarAdmin
POST {{userUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Admin",
  "apellido": "General",
  "dni": "10000001",
  "telefono": "2614001122",
  "mail": "admin@eventos.com",
  "password": "PasswordAdmin123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 2.2 Login ADMIN (Copia el accessToken de la respuesta)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{userUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mail": "admin@eventos.com",
  "password": "PasswordAdmin123"
}

### Guardar Token Admin
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2.3 Registro de Usuario USER (Cliente)
# @name registrarCliente
POST {{userUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "dni": "20000002",
  "telefono": "2614003344",
  "mail": "juan@correo.com",
  "password": "PasswordJuan123",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 2.4 Login USER (Cliente)
# @name loginCliente
POST {{userUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mail": "juan@correo.com",
  "password": "PasswordJuan123"
}

### Guardar Token Cliente y User ID
@userToken = {{loginCliente.response.body.accessToken}}
@userId = {{loginCliente.response.body.usuario.id}}

### ==============================================================================
### 3. GESTIÓN DE INVENTARIO Y STOCK (INVENTORY SERVICE)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Consulta de Catálogo (Público)
GET {{inventoryUrl}}/api/inventario

### 3.2 Modificación de Stock como ADMIN (Fijar en 1 para prueba de concurrencia)
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/inventario/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto": "Entrada Conferencia",
  "stock": 1
}

### 3.3 Intento de Modificación de Stock como USER normal (Debe devolver 403 Forbidden)
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/inventario/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto": "Entrada Conferencia",
  "stock": 999
}

### ==============================================================================
### 4. COMPRAS Y CONCURRENCIA (CHECKOUT SERVICE)
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Compra Exitosa (Petición 1)
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/api/comprar
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto": "Entrada Conferencia"
}

### 4.2 Compra Rechazada por Stock Agotado (Petición 2 - Debe devolver 400 Bad Request)
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/api/comprar
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto": "Entrada Conferencia"
}

### 4.3 Intento de Compra sin Token (Debe devolver 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/api/comprar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto": "Entrada Conferencia"
}

### ==============================================================================
### 5. PROPIEDAD DEL RECURSO (USER SERVICE)
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 Consultar Propio Perfil (Debe devolver 200 OK)
GET {{userUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5.2 Consultar Perfil Ajeno como USER (Debe devolver 403 Forbidden)
GET {{userUrl}}/api/usuarios/660000000000000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5.3 Listar Todos los Usuarios como ADMIN (Debe devolver 200 OK)
GET {{userUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
